WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:01.650
OK.

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:05.660
Along the same lines, I'm getting martial
law questions and they relate not just to

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:07.980
coronavirus but to the election.

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:13.549
And the question is, David, will Donald Trump
declare martial law and suspend the election

00:00:13.549 --> 00:00:16.560
due to Corona virus?

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:19.720
We already talked about this a little bit
earlier this week when we got a voicemail.

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:25.900
So martial law is when military control is
placed over civilian functions of government.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:31.039
So this would be if there's an emergency,
a major disaster, terrorist attack in an occupied

00:00:31.039 --> 00:00:32.730
territory, et cetera.

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:39.480
It is very complicated legal territory when
it comes to things that require that that

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:42.100
are sort of bound by the law.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:48.670
The election date and when electors need to
formally cast their ballots for the candidate

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:53.550
that won on election day is prescribed in
the Constitution.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:58.710
And so you would need Congress to say something
about the election being moved to a different

00:00:58.710 --> 00:01:00.060
day this year.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:03.420
December 14th is when the electors are supposed
to vote.

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:11.850
If Massachusetts votes for Biden, the electors
on December 14th need to go and say Massachusetts

00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:19.210
casts our electors for Joe Biden at then the
delegate counting convention, whatever, to

00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:20.960
go beyond December 14.

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:25.330
With that, it would take an act of Congress
or something extraordinary.

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:33.050
Now, where it starts to get dicey is if you
have martial law and civilian courts are closed,

00:01:33.050 --> 00:01:36.690
imagine that there is such a lockdown that
martial law is put in place.

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:40.440
And it's not just restaurants and public transit
that are shut down.

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:43.270
Civilian court courts are closed.

00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:51.909
Martial law could dictate that military courts
start to get involved in adjudicating some

00:01:51.909 --> 00:01:53.000
of these things.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:58.460
It's conceivable that moving the election
beyond when December 14th would be the date

00:01:58.460 --> 00:02:05.710
where the electors vote up could end up going
to courts if the civilian courts are down.

00:02:05.710 --> 00:02:07.740
It could conceivably go to a military court.

00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:09.379
This is insanely unlikely.

00:02:09.379 --> 00:02:16.299
Now, I want to remind folks who like the idea
of martial law to keep Trump in power.

00:02:16.299 --> 00:02:22.909
Number one, either way, even if there's no
election, Donald Trump's term constitutionally

00:02:22.909 --> 00:02:26.140
ends on January 20, 2021.

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:27.140
At that point.

00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:31.129
Again, it's contested exactly the logistics,
but the speaker of the House would become

00:02:31.129 --> 00:02:33.189
president of the United States.

00:02:33.189 --> 00:02:35.379
That is scheduled to be Nancy Pelosi.

00:02:35.379 --> 00:02:36.379
That's number one.

00:02:36.379 --> 00:02:40.549
And so I don't know that from this are really
well served by focusing on this.

00:02:40.549 --> 00:02:45.430
Number two, typically when martial law is
declared, guns are confiscated.

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:46.430
OK.

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:52.129
Again, I don't know that the pro-Trump gun
nuts are going to be thrilled if the martial

00:02:52.129 --> 00:02:57.080
law they believe might keep Trump in is also
used as a justification to start confiscating

00:02:57.080 --> 00:02:58.080
their guns.

00:02:58.080 --> 00:02:59.080
It will probably get ugly.

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:01.319
Checkpoints typically get set up in cities.

00:03:01.319 --> 00:03:02.889
It's all very, very bad.

00:03:02.889 --> 00:03:07.249
So let's all not be hoping for that, regardless
of whether it might keep Trump in office an

00:03:07.249 --> 00:03:08.469
extra month or something.

00:03:08.469 --> 00:03:10.579
It's unlikely to do that.

00:03:10.579 --> 00:03:15.370
And these are exactly the type of questions
that really expose the degree of uncertainty

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:16.779
and fear that is going on.

00:03:16.779 --> 00:03:17.909
And I sympathize with that.

00:03:17.909 --> 00:03:20.989
But let's all work together here.

00:03:20.989 --> 00:03:27.549
Think not just of yourself, but of other people,
do what the experts are asking you to do.

00:03:27.549 --> 00:03:32.700
And hopefully we can start to turn this curve,
find that inflection point and turn things

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:37.420
in the right direction so we can have an election
on schedule, we can have a peaceful transfer

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:39.349
of power if that is what the voters decide.

